WEBVTT

01:01.600 --> 01:06.020
<i><b>Childhood Days</b></i>

01:09.650 --> 01:14.530
Manila, Philippines

01:17.820 --> 01:24.580
<b><i>Whenever I'm in a city like this, it reminds
me of the women who raised me...</i></b>

01:29.000 --> 01:30.290
<b>Let go!</b>

01:30.290 --> 01:34.220
<b>Let go, man!</b>

01:31.550 --> 01:36.010
London, Soho

01:34.220 --> 01:36.820
<b>That's enough of that!</b>

01:37.470 --> 01:40.930
<b>Honestly, you and your fighting!</b>

01:42.470 --> 01:45.940
<b>I'm going to see that Carol
gives you a real earful, this time!</b>

01:47.520 --> 01:48.400
<b>I'm going out.</b>

01:48.400 --> 01:49.900
<b>I can't breathe, let me go!</b>

01:51.400 --> 01:52.270
<b>Huh?</b>

01:58.160 --> 01:58.740
<b>Hey, Carol!</b>

01:58.740 --> 01:59.820
<b>Eric!</b>

01:59.820 --> 02:01.580
<b>Again!?</b>

02:01.580 --> 02:04.660
<b>Don't be causing such
a fuss this late in the day!</b>

02:04.660 --> 02:06.540
<b>It's going to eat into my business!</b>

02:07.000 --> 02:08.920
<b>Now, see here, Carol!</b>

02:08.920 --> 02:11.040
<b>I wouldn't just blurt that out!</b>

02:11.040 --> 02:13.400
<b>You know the Met are keeping
their eye on you...</b>

02:14.510 --> 02:16.630
<b>So what if they do?</b>

02:16.920 --> 02:18.430
<b>Eric...</b>

02:18.430 --> 02:20.110
<b>Why'd you get into
a fight this time?</b>

02:21.390 --> 02:24.890
<b>A bunch of guys snatched
a purse off an old lady...</b>

02:24.890 --> 02:26.390
<b>so I punched them.</b>

02:26.770 --> 02:29.560
<b>Couldn't you have
come to me, instead?</b>

02:30.480 --> 02:32.650
<b>Did you get the money back?</b>

02:33.270 --> 02:34.110
<b>Yeah.</b>

02:34.780 --> 02:35.730
<b>Good job!</b>

02:35.730 --> 02:36.650
<b>I'm proud!</b>

02:37.280 --> 02:38.990
<b>Are you sure that's a good idea?</b>

02:38.990 --> 02:44.410
<b>Fights like this are best done while you're
a kid and the stakes are nice and low!</b>

02:44.410 --> 02:50.540
<b>And I promised my best friend, Tara,
that I would raise Eric into a fine man,</b>

02:51.130 --> 02:53.270
<b>so I'm not letting you
take him into state care!</b>

02:53.790 --> 02:55.460
<b>That's right!</b>

02:55.460 --> 02:57.420
<b>Eric's our kid!</b>

02:57.670 --> 03:00.180
<b>We're not handing him over!</b>

03:00.180 --> 03:01.720
<b>Piss off!</b>

03:01.720 --> 03:03.430
<b>Good work, Eric!</b>

03:03.760 --> 03:06.720
<b>Eric, come by my room tonight, okay?</b>

03:06.720 --> 03:08.140
<b>What are you babbling about?</b>

03:08.140 --> 03:10.770
<b>We're gonna watch TV tonight!</b>

03:10.770 --> 03:11.600
<b>I don't think so!</b>

03:12.520 --> 03:13.560
<b>Well, that's how it is.</b>

03:13.560 --> 03:17.280
<b>I'm going to work, so take a shower,
and have dinner.</b>

03:18.530 --> 03:20.570
<b>I'm heading out, Eric.</b>

03:21.240 --> 03:23.030
<b>Have a good night, Carol.</b>

03:24.780 --> 03:26.790
<b>I-I say!</b>

03:26.790 --> 03:28.910
<b>Shoot, I better get going too!</b>

03:37.760 --> 03:39.550
<b>I'm home, Mom.</b>

03:46.100 --> 03:47.630
<b>What are you doing?</b>

03:47.630 --> 03:48.610
<b>Nothing.</b>

04:34.850 --> 04:36.020
<b>I'm home!</b>

04:38.650 --> 04:42.070
<b>What, did you have
a nightmare again?</b>

04:45.570 --> 04:49.830
<b>There was this big,
scary shadow chasing after me...</b>

04:51.250 --> 04:57.330
<b>Maybe you're having bad dreams
because I brought up your mom.</b>

04:58.210 --> 05:01.550
<b>It's been ten years; time really flies.</b>

05:02.670 --> 05:06.300
<b>Tara was so happy when
she found out she was pregnant.</b>

05:06.890 --> 05:08.970
<b>She was sure it'd be a boy,</b>

05:08.970 --> 05:13.310
<b>and she was going to name him Eric,
and make sure to raise him right.</b>

05:13.640 --> 05:15.890
<b>She was really excited.</b>

05:17.940 --> 05:19.860
<b>Listen, Eric...</b>

05:19.860 --> 05:21.650
<b>you're not alone.</b>

05:22.150 --> 05:24.240
<b>Tara's always going to be with you.</b>

05:25.070 --> 05:27.110
<b>There's nothing to be afraid of.</b>

05:30.030 --> 05:33.080
<b>So don't look so gloomy all the time!</b>

05:33.080 --> 05:36.830
<b>No matter what happens,
we'll all protect you!</b>

05:36.830 --> 05:38.290
<b>I know!</b>

05:38.290 --> 05:41.090
<b>I know, Carol,
but I can't breath!</b>

05:41.340 --> 05:42.170
<b>Good!</b>

05:42.170 --> 05:46.550
<b>So forget about your stupid dream,
and go back to bed!</b>

05:49.010 --> 05:51.470
<b>Thank you, Carol...</b>

05:52.970 --> 05:53.770
<b>Good night.</b>

05:57.140 --> 05:57.940
<b>Good night.</b>

06:17.460 --> 06:22.340
<b>Well, Tara, being a mother
isn't so bad after all.</b>

06:42.020 --> 06:47.740
<b>But my nightmare became reality,
that same day...</b>

07:03.460 --> 07:07.510
<b>The victim was apparently a member
of a group of local punks.</b>

07:07.510 --> 07:11.470
<b>Pretty rough treatment he got...</b>

07:19.560 --> 07:20.980
<b>That weird smell...</b>

07:20.980 --> 07:22.810
<b>what is it...!?</b>

07:43.500 --> 07:44.880
<b>Eric.</b>

07:51.550 --> 07:53.010
<b>Eric...</b>

07:55.010 --> 07:55.970
<b>Who is it?</b>

08:26.040 --> 08:27.170
<b><i>Something...</i></b>

08:27.170 --> 08:28.550
<b><i>something's over there!</i></b>

08:34.380 --> 08:35.400
<b>Carol!</b>

08:35.680 --> 08:37.430
<b>No, let go!</b>

08:44.440 --> 08:45.690
<b>Let go!</b>

08:45.690 --> 08:48.320
<b>That's how things are around here.</b>

08:48.320 --> 08:48.920
<b>But...</b>

08:49.650 --> 08:51.440
<b>What exactly are you gonna do?</b>

08:52.150 --> 08:54.240
<b>Can you change this whole town's situation?</b>

08:59.580 --> 09:00.540
<b>Dammit.</b>

09:06.170 --> 09:06.920
<b>Let's go.</b>

09:27.400 --> 09:30.570
<b>Your partner's apparently located us.</b>

09:31.980 --> 09:35.860
<b>I'll be greeting him later tonight, I hope you look forward to it.</b>

09:36.820 --> 09:40.080
<b>I wonder if it'll work out that way...</b>

09:40.080 --> 09:40.590
<b>What?</b>

09:41.330 --> 09:42.470
<b>What do you mean?</b>

09:43.040 --> 09:49.630
<b>You had better pray that things turn out
to be as predictable as you want.</b>

09:49.630 --> 09:50.710
<b>Bullshit!</b>

09:54.300 --> 09:57.550
<b>I'm going to carve Blade up,
right in front of you...</b>

09:58.430 --> 09:59.800
<b>Get ready for it.</b>

10:14.070 --> 10:16.450
<b>Dad, I'm gonna save you!</b>

10:23.580 --> 10:24.770
<b>Dad, don't...!</b>

10:36.800 --> 10:38.300
<b>Dammit!</b>

10:38.300 --> 10:39.760
<b>Goddammit!</b>

10:47.600 --> 10:48.980
<b>How long have you been there?</b>

10:56.570 --> 10:58.030
<b>I guess you overheard.</b>

10:58.900 --> 11:00.320
<b>Go ahead and laugh.</b>

11:01.660 --> 11:03.530
<b>I don't see what's funny.</b>

11:03.530 --> 11:07.330
<b>I came after you to
get revenge for my Dad...</b>

11:08.660 --> 11:10.540
<b>and now, I'm...</b>

11:11.170 --> 11:14.040
<b>If you hate me,
then try and kill me.</b>

11:15.090 --> 11:17.050
<b>It's true that I killed your old man.</b>

11:20.630 --> 11:22.300
<b>The boat's about to leave.</b>

11:23.640 --> 11:24.720
<b>What are you going to do?</b>

11:27.270 --> 11:28.980
<b>Can I ask you something?</b>

11:29.730 --> 11:30.560
<b>What?</b>

11:31.190 --> 11:36.070
<b>The thing that Noah said,
about the darkness inside of you...</b>

11:36.070 --> 11:37.280
<b>what is it?</b>

12:15.900 --> 12:16.610
<b>Carol!</b>

12:30.370 --> 12:31.370
<b>You...</b>

12:31.370 --> 12:32.210
<b>No way...</b>

12:33.420 --> 12:34.960
<b>Is that you...</b>

12:34.960 --> 12:36.080
<b>Mom?</b>

12:37.460 --> 12:38.630
<b>Boy...</b>

12:38.630 --> 12:40.510
<b>you're my boy, aren't you?</b>

12:40.510 --> 12:42.060
<b>I've missed you...</b>

12:42.590 --> 12:43.300
<b>How!?</b>

12:43.930 --> 12:45.680
<b>My Mom's supposed to be dead!</b>

12:46.600 --> 12:49.390
<b>I've been waiting for a long time.</b>

12:50.140 --> 12:54.690
<b>Now we can go to him, together...</b>

12:55.730 --> 13:00.570
<b>And you will fulfill your life's purpose.</b>

13:06.070 --> 13:07.530
<b>Now...</b>

13:09.370 --> 13:10.740
<b>Come to me...</b>

13:17.080 --> 13:18.290
<b>Stay back!</b>

13:18.290 --> 13:20.460
<b>Boy, what are you saying?</b>

13:21.670 --> 13:24.050
<b>Your mother's come back for you...</b>

13:27.260 --> 13:29.930
<b>You killed Carol and the others!</b>

13:37.190 --> 13:39.360
<b>You're not my mother!</b>

14:00.250 --> 14:01.380
<b>Carol...</b>

14:04.590 --> 14:05.920
<b>How could this-?</b>

14:10.100 --> 14:11.430
<b>Eric...</b>

14:16.430 --> 14:19.400
<b>I'm sorry, Eric...</b>

14:20.730 --> 14:22.070
<b>I'm so sorry...</b>

14:23.820 --> 14:25.610
<b>Mom...</b>

14:43.040 --> 14:44.050
<b>Mom...</b>

14:45.210 --> 14:47.630
<b>Mom!</b>

14:52.930 --> 14:57.230
<b>The first vampire I killed
was my own mother.</b>

14:59.190 --> 15:02.110
<b>Being turned makes people
lose their humanity.</b>

15:03.570 --> 15:08.900
<b>And I'll never forget the tears on my mother's
face, when she regained it in the very end.</b>

15:10.450 --> 15:13.120
<b>I can't change the past.</b>

15:13.120 --> 15:20.120
<b>When it happened, my vampire blood
may have just been lashing out...</b>

15:22.000 --> 15:24.750
<b>That's what he meant...</b>

15:26.000 --> 15:30.090
<b>By denying that blood,
and hunting them,</b>

15:30.090 --> 15:31.800
<b>I can maintain my humanity.</b>

15:33.220 --> 15:36.560
<b>But the fear of having to fight
against that madness...</b>

15:37.560 --> 15:41.350
<b>There's a chance that fear could
overwhelm me, make me give in,</b>

15:41.350 --> 15:43.230
<b>and then I end up causing more fear.</b>

15:50.200 --> 15:51.320
<b>This is where we part ways.</b>

15:58.790 --> 16:01.160
<b>I appreciate it, Captain.</b>

16:01.160 --> 16:02.250
<b>Don't worry about it.</b>

16:02.250 --> 16:03.880
<b>Just get Noah back.</b>

16:04.330 --> 16:04.830
<b>Right.</b>

16:06.290 --> 16:07.000
<b>Hang on.</b>

16:08.800 --> 16:09.880
<b>I'll back you up.</b>

16:10.630 --> 16:12.470
<b>I'm a vampire hunter too.</b>

16:25.360 --> 16:26.520
<b><i>There it is.</i></b>

16:35.870 --> 16:37.950
<b>Blade's at the port!</b>

16:37.950 --> 16:40.290
<b>He's going after
the slave trader ship!</b>

16:40.750 --> 16:41.960
<b>What!?</b>

16:41.960 --> 16:44.710
<b>Why didn't he come
after our hostage?</b>

16:44.710 --> 16:45.920
<b>What're you going to do?</b>

16:46.840 --> 16:51.090
<b>If I were you, I'd probably want
to take care of that.</b>

16:51.880 --> 16:52.970
<b>Shut it!</b>

16:52.970 --> 16:54.180
<b>Shut your mouth!</b>

16:56.930 --> 16:59.260
<b>Let's get a move on,
we need to get to the boat!</b>

17:23.080 --> 17:24.080
<b>Who the hell are you!?</b>

17:24.830 --> 17:25.960
<b>You bitch!</b>

17:32.880 --> 17:33.470
<b>Razor!</b>

17:49.480 --> 17:50.540
<b>Are you alright?!</b>

17:51.860 --> 17:53.940
<b>Terribly sorry, miss...</b>

17:54.490 --> 17:59.370
<b>You caught me just as
I was about to leave.</b>

17:59.910 --> 18:02.040
<b>Sure you were, old man.</b>

18:16.720 --> 18:18.640
<b>Damn you!</b>

18:21.140 --> 18:22.260
<b>Die!</b>

18:44.620 --> 18:47.330
<b>Die!</b>

19:10.060 --> 19:15.110
THE FIRST
BLADE

19:10.810 --> 19:15.110
SAVAGE
MOON

19:16.030 --> 19:19.700
<b>Forgive me, Master Frost!</b>

19:27.870 --> 19:29.500
<b>Well, I'm red in the face.</b>

19:29.500 --> 19:32.540
<b>Can't believe I let myself
get kidnapped like that.</b>

19:33.590 --> 19:35.090
<b>Sorry for the trouble...</b>

19:35.090 --> 19:35.750
<b>Nah.</b>

19:36.630 --> 19:39.340
<b>I'm going after Frost.</b>

19:39.340 --> 19:41.630
<b>You should get some rest.</b>

19:41.630 --> 19:46.260
<b>Oh, that reminds me,
while I was tied up...</b>

19:46.260 --> 19:51.900
<b>they mentioned something about Frost having built
a fortress on one of the islands in this region.</b>

19:51.900 --> 19:54.520
<b>Also, and this is just a rumor,</b>

19:55.020 --> 19:59.240
<b>but it seems Frost has spurred
the pure-bloods into action.</b>

20:00.150 --> 20:01.030
<b>Be careful out there.</b>

20:02.200 --> 20:03.030
<b>Got it.</b>

20:07.240 --> 20:08.450
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:08.450 --> 20:10.040
<b>Aren't you going?</b>

20:11.000 --> 20:11.920
<b>I...</b>

20:13.330 --> 20:14.750
<b>Do me a favor.</b>

20:14.750 --> 20:17.650
<b>Could you help Eric out,
in my place?</b>

20:18.550 --> 20:21.550
<b>Despite how he acts, he's better off
with someone looking out for him.</b>

20:24.220 --> 20:27.310
<b>And Razor's taken a liking to you...</b>

20:27.310 --> 20:29.060
<b>you should take him along.</b>

20:31.680 --> 20:35.690
<b>If you have any intention
of forgiving him...</b>

20:35.690 --> 20:36.770
<b>please.</b>

20:39.070 --> 20:39.730
<b>What's wrong?</b>

20:40.650 --> 20:43.570
<b>You're letting your vendetta get away.</b>

20:44.820 --> 20:45.740
<b>Yeah...</b>

20:45.740 --> 20:46.820
<b>I guess so.</b>

20:47.740 --> 20:48.950
<b>Come on, Razor!</b>

20:51.960 --> 20:55.210
<b>Make sure you feed him
the good stuff!</b>

20:55.210 --> 20:57.920
<b>And don't let him eat
any vampire flesh!</b>

21:06.300 --> 21:08.850
<b>I thought he would be
too much for Matthes...</b>

21:10.680 --> 21:13.270
<b>But there's no need
for my involvement, yet.</b>

21:14.560 --> 21:15.980
<b>We're headed to the island.</b>

23:03.040 --> 23:04.150
<b>Blade...</b>

23:04.920 --> 23:09.260
<b>The key to Frost's ambitions, who holds
the fate of the nobles' lives in his hands...</b>

23:09.260 --> 23:11.220
<b>The only living Daywalker...</b>

23:12.390 --> 23:14.720
<b>This is his blood.</b>

23:15.640 --> 23:16.560
<b>It's Manananggal!</b>

23:17.180 --> 23:18.020
<b>That's...!</b>

23:19.140 --> 23:21.480
<b>O beast born out of
eternal darkness...</b>

23:21.900 --> 23:25.360
<b>by the guidance of
the white spirits, begone!</b>

23:25.690 --> 23:31.070
<i><b>The Glowing Island{</b></i>

23:26.360 --> 23:29.490
<b>Next time on Blade, The Glowing Island.</b>
